      7 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انبتر</span></b>  <i>It</i> (a tail or the like, T) <i>became cut,</i> or
<i>cut off,</i> (T, S, M, K, TA,) <i>in any place,</i> (M,) or
<i>entirely;</i> (T, M;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تبتّر</span></b>  signifies the same.
(TA.)

